  "description": "meme-id: long_time_no_see_nigger; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man in cowboy attire standing in front of a wooden wagon, with the text 'long time no see' at the top and 'nigger' at the bottom. The use of the racial slur 'nigger' is a direct and hateful attack targeting Black individuals. The juxtaposition of the seemingly benign phrase 'long time no see' with the derogatory racial term creates a toxic and offensive message. This meme is designed to perpetuate racial hatred and is harmful to Black communities by invoking a historically violent and dehumanizing slur. The overall intent is to demean and insult based on race, fitting squarely under the 'Hateful' category as it directly attacks individuals based on their racial identity.",
